## 🚀 Featured Projects
{% for category in profile.featured %}
### {{ category.emoji }} {{ category.title }}
{% if category.description is defined %}
*{{ category.description }}*
{% endif %}
{%- for entry in category.projects %}
* **[{{ entry.label|default(entry.repo|split("/")|last) }}]({{ repo_link(entry.repo) }})** {{ project_skills(entry) }}
{%- if entry.headline is defined %}
    > **{{ entry.headline }}**
{%- endif %}
    > {{ entry.description }}
{%- endfor %}
{% endfor %}
